<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs 1996 net profit 136 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs 1996 net profit 136 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     profit 136  vs	 loss 65</p>
<p>    Net per share (francs)			18  vs	    -</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			  7  vs	   n/a</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     353  vs	     394</p>
<p>    Investments				    439  vs	     480</p>
<p>    Turnover				     8,671  vs	   8,819</p>
<p>NOTE - Chargeurs International said in its earnings statement it expected improved results in 1997 barring unforeseen changes in the economic environment.</p>
<p>&quot;The group is pursuing the vigorous recovery plan for its wool activities, helped since the start of the year by favourable wool prices and by orders higher than those at the end of February 1996,&quot; Chargeurs said.</p>
<p>&quot;The monetary context is favourable for the whole of the group's activities. Barring a change in this environment, Chargeurs International should continue the improvement in its results in 1997 while stressing international development,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
